//katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/55924/pdf"}, {"title": "katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl", "url": "https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/49147/pdf"}, {"title": "katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl", "url": "https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/10807/pdf"}]}, "I couldn't find a date of birth for Anton Grylewicz in these results. None of the results mention a person with that exact name.\n\nThe closest hits are other people:\n- Several records for people named Grylewicz, including Helena, Jan, Henryk, Czesław Kazimierz and Adam, with their own birth dates. These are different individuals, and none is listed as Anton.\n- A Katyn victim, Antoni Garmulewicz, born 10 I 1891. The surname differs, so this is probably not the same person.\n\nA search of Polish archives such as the IPN databases, or a variant spelling, may help."], "durationSeconds": 5.337614333, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01MCdhKuVbHqE2cAwCGkNgto", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01GSeEveecBEEDdWbCWfAwHZ", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://www.timeout.com/movies/the-spongebob-movie-sponge-out-of-water\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt2279373/similar\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.movieinsider.com/m9973/3/spongebob-squarepants-2/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt2279373\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.movieinsider.com/m9973/6/spongebob-squarepants-2/\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.boxofficemojo.com/release/rl2422572033/weekend\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.boxofficemojo.com/release/rl3110437889/weekend\"}, {\"url\": \"https://admin.moviebuff.com/the-spongebob-movie-sponge-out-of-water\"}, {\"url\": \"https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/The_SpongeBob_Movie:_Sponge_Out_of_Water\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:02:16.845Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "The SpongeBob SquarePants Movie: Sponge Out of Water release date", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_014jVkRYGX3zRWZNi7gfVttX", "content": [{"title": "SpongeBob SquarePants in THE SPONGEBOB MOVIE: SPONGE OUT OF WATER,", "url": "https://www.timeout.com/movies/the-spongebob-movie-sponge-out-of-water"}, {"title": "www.boxofficemojo.com", "url": "https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt2279373/similar"}, {"title": "SpongeBob: Sponge Out of Water Movie", "url": "https://www.movieinsider.com/m9973/3/spongebob-squarepants-2/"}, {"title": "www.boxofficemojo.com", "url": "https://www.boxofficemojo.com/title/tt2279373"}, {"title": "SpongeBob: Sponge Out of Water Movie", "url": "https://www.movieinsider.com/m9973/6/spongebob-squarepants-2/"}, {"title": "The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water", "url": "https://www.boxofficemojo.com/release/rl2422572033/weekend"}, {"title": "The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water", "url": "https://www.boxofficemojo.com/release/rl3110437889/weekend"}, {"title": "The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water (2015)", "url": "https://admin.moviebuff.com/the-spongebob-movie-sponge-out-of-water"}, {"title": "The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water", "url": "https://simple.wikipedia.com/wiki/The_SpongeBob_Movie:_Sponge_Out_of_Water"}]}, "The main release date was **February 6, 2015** in the US. Several sources agree on this, and it is the date the film's own record gives as its domestic debut.\n\n- **US release:** Box Office Mojo lists a domestic release of Feb 6, 2015 The SpongeBob Movie: Sponge Out of Water (2015), and Wikipedia confirms it was released theatrically on February 6, 2015.\n- **Earlier and later dates:** Box Office Mojo lists an Earliest Release Date of January 28, 2015 (Belgium). Its UK release came on Mar 27, 2015 Release Date Mar 27, 2015, and India followed on 08 May 2015.\n- **Conflicting source:** Time Out gives Friday 27 March 2015 as the release date. That matches the UK date rather than the US one.\n- **Planned date change:** Moviebuff says the film was originally going to be released in late 2014, with a later planned date of March 27, 2015, and eventually ended up being released on February 6th, 2015."], "durationSeconds": 7.254518666999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01GSeEveecBEEDdWbCWfAwHZ", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
