{"type": "user", "message": {"role": "user", "content": [{"tool_use_id": "toolu_01K9THxdTGeRt2EctC2iWUhe", "type": "tool_result", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "{\"excerpt_removed\": true, \"references\": [{\"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anton_Grylewicz\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.marxists.org/history/etol/revhist/backiss/vol2/no4/jpsteff.html\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.marxists.org/francais/trotsky/oeuvres/1930/05/300521a.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/137961/pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://www.marxists.org/francais/trotsky/oeuvres/1932/10/lt07101932.htm\"}, {\"url\": \"https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/571384/pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://inwentarz.ipn.gov.pl/print/pdf/node/5258297\"}, {\"url\": \"https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/10807/pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/55924/pdf\"}, {\"url\": \"https://alchetron.com/Anton-Grylewicz\"}]}"}]}]}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-20T13:02:26.589Z", "tool_use_result": {"query": "Anton Grylewicz German communist Trotskyist born 1885", "results": [{"tool_use_id": "srvtoolu_015MTR1xF1qRag9FA3jdABSW", "content": [{"title": "Anton Grylewicz", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anton_Grylewicz"}, {"title": "Encyclopedia of Trotskyism On-Line: Revolutionary History", "url": "https://www.marxists.org/history/etol/revhist/backiss/vol2/no4/jpsteff.html"}, {"title": "www.marxists.org", "url": "https://www.marxists.org/francais/trotsky/oeuvres/1930/05/300521a.htm"}, {"title": "katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl", "url": "https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/137961/pdf"}, {"title": "www.marxists.org", "url": "https://www.marxists.org/francais/trotsky/oeuvres/1932/10/lt07101932.htm"}, {"title": "katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl", "url": "https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/571384/pdf"}, {"title": "inwentarz.ipn.gov.pl", "url": "https://inwentarz.ipn.gov.pl/print/pdf/node/5258297"}, {"title": "katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl", "url": "https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/10807/pdf"}, {"title": "katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl", "url": "https://katalog.bip.ipn.gov.pl/informacje/55924/pdf"}, {"title": "Tripti Joshi (Editor)", "url": "https://alchetron.com/Anton-Grylewicz"}]}, "Anton Grylewicz was a German communist who later became a Trotskyist. The sources agree on the core biography, though most of the detail comes from one Wikipedia article and its mirror.\n\n- **Basic facts:** Wikipedia gives his birth as 8 January 1885 in Berlin and his death as 2 August 1971 in West Berlin. He sat in the Prussian Landtag from 1925 to 1928 and in the Reichstag briefly in 1924–25 (Wikipedia infobox).\n- **Early life:** He came from a working-class Berlin family, trained as a locksmith, and joined the SPD in 1912. He served on the Eastern Front during the First World War until he was wounded (Wikipedia).\n- **Communist years:** He moved from the USPD into the KPD after the fusion. He led the KPD's Berlin-Brandenburg organisation, took part in the preparations for the abortive 1923 uprising, and was tried alongside Arkadi Maslow but received an amnesty. He was removed from the party leadership in 1926 and expelled after speaking for the Left Opposition (Wikipedia).\n- **Trotskyism:** Per the alchetron mirror of the Wikipedia text, he was a founding member of the Leninbund and led its Trotskyist minority before groups merged (alchetron). Leon Trotsky's letters to him from 1930 and 1932 are preserved on marxists.org, which confirms the relationship (marxists.org, 1930 letter).\n\nThe search also returned unrelated Polish IPN records for other people with similar surnames, which I excluded. I did not find a second independent biography to cross-check the dates or the Leninbund details."], "durationSeconds": 6.468159125000001, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_01K9THxdTGeRt2EctC2iWUhe", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
